# One real LU paper, written by hand as triples (Session 2, step 2b).
# Values copied from data/show_paper.py; names follow D3 (report/decisions.md).
# The mapping (step 4) must produce these same triples for this paper.

@prefix pub:        <https://ul.edu.lb/kr/pub#> .
@prefix xsd:        <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
